{"type":"message","id":"f55c613c","parentId":"b84f0b25","timestamp":"2026-03-04T07:19:05.983Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Wed 2026-03-04 15:19 GMT+8] [Subagent Context] You are running as a subagent (depth 1/2). Results auto-announce to your requester; do not busy-poll for status.\n\n[Subagent Task]: ## 任务: ParMETIS 算法正确性测试（更正版）\n\n### ParMETIS 核心价值\n用 `n_mpi` 个 MPI 进程**协作**剖分大网格文件，解决串行剖分太慢的问题。\n\n### 正确理解\n- `mpirun -n n_mpi cutter.exe -m pipe.cgns -np n_mesh`\n  - **n_mpi**: 参与剖分计算的 MPI 进程数（可以不等于 n_mesh）\n  - **n_mesh**: 最终剖分成的块数\n- CFD 模拟：`mpirun -n n_mesh incomACT.exe -c pipe.yaml`（进程数 = 剖分数）\n\n### 测试矩阵\n\n| 测试 | 剖分命令 | 模拟命令 | 预期结果 |\n|------|----------|----------|----------|\n| 1 | `mpirun -n 2 cutter.exe -np 2` | `mpirun -n 2 incomACT.exe` | ✅ 收敛 |\n| 2 | `mpirun -n 2 cutter.exe -np 4` | `mpirun -n 4 incomACT.exe` | ✅ 收敛 |\n| 3 | `mpirun -n 4 cutter.exe -np 4` | `mpirun -n 4 incomACT.exe` | ✅ 收敛 |\n| 4 | `mpirun -n 1 cutter.exe -np 4` | `mpirun -n 4 incomACT.exe` | ✅ 收敛 |\n| 5 | `mpirun -n 4 cutter.exe -np 2` | `mpirun -n 2 incomACT.exe` | ✅ 收敛 |\n\n### 测试步骤\n\n```bash\ncd /home/one/projects/cgnsMeshCutter/build\nsource ../env.sh\nexport PATH=$MPI_ROOT/bin:$PATH\nexport LD_LIBRARY_PATH=$CGNS_ROOT/lib:$METIS_ROOT/lib:$PARMETIS_ROOT/lib:$MPI_ROOT/lib:$LD_LIBRARY_PATH\n\n# 每次测试前清理\nrm -f decomposed_mesh_*.cgns\n\n# Test 1: n_mpi=2, np=2\nmpirun -n 2 ./cutter.exe -t metis -m pipe.cgns -np 2\nmpirun -n 2 /home/one/app/act/incomACT.exe -c pipe.yaml\n\n# Test 2: n_mpi=2, np=4\nrm -f decomposed_mesh_*.cgns\nmpirun -n 2 ./cutter.exe -t metis -m pipe.cgns -np 4\nmpirun -n 4 /home/one/app/act/incomACT.exe -c pipe.yaml\n\n# Test 3: n_mpi=4, np=4\nrm -f decomposed_mesh_*.cgns\nmpirun -n 4 ./cutter.exe -t metis -m pipe.cgns -np 4\nmpirun -n 4 /home/one/app/act/incomACT.exe -c pipe.yaml\n\n# Test 4: n_mpi=1, np=4 (串行剖分 4 块)\nrm -f decomposed_mesh_*.cgns\nmpirun -n 1 ./cutter.exe -t metis -m pipe.cgns -np 4\nmpirun -n 4 /home/one/app/act/incomACT.exe -c pipe.yaml\n\n# Test 5: n_mpi=4, np=2\nrm -f decomposed_mesh_*.cgns\nmpirun -n 4 ./cutter.exe -t metis -m pipe.cgns -np 2\nmpirun -n 2 /home/one/app/act/incomACT.exe -c pipe.yaml\n```\n\n### 验证标准\n1. 剖分成功：生成 `decomposed_mesh_0.cgns` 到 `decomposed_mesh_{np-1}.cgns`\n2. 模拟收敛：残差 < 1e-6\n\n### 输出要求\n生成测试报告，记录每个测试用例：\n- 剖分是否成功\n- 生成的文件数是否正确\n- CFD 模拟是否收敛\n- 残差值和耗时\n\n### 如果发现问题\n直接调用 code-agent 进行修复，不要等待。"}],"timestamp":1772608745980}}
