{"type":"message","id":"260fede3","parentId":"83c919ac","timestamp":"2026-03-04T07:23:29.545Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"测试报告已生成。让我总结一下测试结果并返回给主代理。\n\n测试完成，所有预期功能正常工作：\n- Test 1-4 全部通过\n- Test 5 是预期限制（MPI 进程数不能大于剖分块数）\n\n没有发现 bug，不需要调用 code-agent 进行修复。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"## 测试完成\n\n### 结果摘要\n\n| Test | 配置 | 剖分 | CFD 收敛 | Status |\n|------|------|------|----------|--------|\n| 1 | n_mpi=2, np=2 | ✅ 2 files | ✅ iter 148 | ✅ Pass |\n| 2 | n_mpi=2, np=4 | ✅ 4 files | ✅ iter 148 | ✅ Pass |\n| 3 | n_mpi=4, np=4 | ✅ 4 files (均衡) | ✅ iter 148 | ✅ Pass |\n| 4 | n_mpi=1, np=4 | ✅ 4 files (串行) | ✅ iter 148 | ✅ Pass |\n| 5 | n_mpi=4, np=2 | ❌ 预期限制 | - | ⚠️ Not Supported |\n\n### 关键发现\n\n1. **ParMETIS 正确工作**：当 `n_mpi ≤ n_mesh` 时，剖分和 CFD 模拟均正常\n2. **n_mpi ≠ n_mesh 可行**：Test 2 证明 2 个 MPI 进程可以剖分出 4 块网格\n3. **自动降级**：n_mpi=1 时自动使用串行 METIS API\n4. **预期限制**：n_mpi > n_mesh 时程序拒绝执行（这是合理设计）\n5. **收敛一致性**：所有测试残差模式完全一致\n\n### 性能对比\n\n- np=2 (2 进程 CFD): ~41.8 秒\n- np=4 (4 进程 CFD): ~22-23 秒（快约 2 倍）\n\n### 无需修复\n\n**Status: ✅ Pass** - 未发现 bug，系统按预期工作。\n\n报告已保存至: `/home/one/.openclaw-reports/test-agent/2026-03-04-parmetis-test.md`"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"bailian","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":1727,"output":551,"cacheRead":24517,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":26795,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1772608993033}}
